# Containers on this gateway run as the iotgw-ctr principal from Quadlet
# units under /etc/containers/systemd/users/<uid>, generated into its user
# manager at boot. podman's own user preset enables a rootless podman API
# socket, auto-update timer and restart units in EVERY user's session
# manager, so each admin login (and the principal's manager) would start a
# podman API for that user. Disabled here; read before podman's
# 98-podman.preset, so these lines win. Nothing on the image needs the API
# socket; a developer who wants it enables it with `systemctl --user enable`.
disable podman.socket
disable podman.service
disable podman-auto-update.timer
disable podman-auto-update.service
disable podman-clean-transient.service
disable podman-restart.service
